{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_25", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -90, "width": 1396, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_26", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -74, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - DESIGN CLONING", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - DESIGN CLONING", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_27", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -38, "width": 1352, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "I rebuild your Landing Page and Thank You Page in the Go High Level page builder. I check colors, fonts and layout side by side until they match the original exactly.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "I rebuild your Landing Page and Thank You Page in the Go High Level page builder. I check colors, fonts and layout side by side until they match the original exactly.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_28", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1492, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - ASSET MIGRATION", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - ASSET MIGRATION", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every image, graphic and piece of copy moves into your GHL media library. Each one goes back\nin the same spot on the new pages, so nothing links back to the old platform.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every image, graphic and piece of copy moves into your GHL media library. Each one goes back\nin the same spot on the new pages, so nothing links back to the old platform.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_31", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2390, "y": -122, "width": 700, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 2412, "y": -106, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - FORM CREATION", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - FORM CREATION", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_33", "type": "text", "x": 2412, "y": -71, "width": 656, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your opt-in form is rebuilt inside Go High Level with the same fields and embedded on the\nnew funnel page. Every lead it captures lands in your GHL contacts. If your old funnel sent\nan email after each opt-in, I'll flag it so it doesn't quietly stop.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your opt-in form is rebuilt inside Go High Level with the same fields and embedded on the\nnew funnel page. Every lead it captures lands in your GHL contacts. If your old funnel sent\nan email after each opt-in, I'll flag it so it doesn't quietly stop.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_34", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3290, "y": -90, "width": 700, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -74, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - MOBILE OPTIMIZATION", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - MOBILE OPTIMIZATION", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -38, "width": 656, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Both pages get checked on desktop, tablet and phone against the original.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Both pages get checked on desktop, tablet and phone against the original.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_37", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4188, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_38", "type": "text", "x": 4210, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - LINK & BUTTON QA", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - LINK & BUTTON QA", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_39", "type": "text", "x": 4210, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every button and link gets clicked, then a test opt-in runs start to finish. Each one has to\ntake the visitor to the correct next step in your GHL funnel.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every button and link gets clicked, then a test opt-in runs start to finish. Each one has to\ntake the visitor to the correct next step in your GHL funnel.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_40"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - I rebuild your landing\npage in the GHL page builder,\nsection by section", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - I rebuild your landing\npage in the GHL page builder,\nsection by section", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_3"